-092-hanxin","book_id":"b-shiji-092","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-092-hanxin"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:p015","text":"齊王廣、龍且并軍與信戰，未合。人或說龍且曰：『漢兵遠鬬窮戰，其鋒不可當。齊、楚自居其地戰，兵易敗散。不如深壁，令齊王使其信臣招所亡城，亡城聞其王在，楚來救，必反漢。漢兵二千里客居，齊城皆反之，其勢無所得食，可無戰而降也。』龍且曰：『吾平生知韓信爲人，易與耳。且夫救齊不戰而降之，吾何功？今戰而勝之，齊之半可得，何爲止！』遂戰，與信夾濰水陳。韓信乃夜令人爲萬餘囊，滿盛沙，壅水上流，引軍半渡，擊龍且，詳不勝，還走。龍且果喜曰：『固知信怯也。』遂追信渡水。信使人決壅囊，水大至。龍且軍大半不得渡，即急擊，殺龍且。龍且水東軍散走，齊王廣亡去。信遂追北至城陽，皆虜楚卒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"齊王廣","kind":"person","person_id":"2sg_8ra_hq5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"xxs_ub0_7rv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"人或說","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定指代保留原文，不補姓名成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"xxs_ub0_7rv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"xxs_ub0_7rv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0164","start":164,"end":165,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0170","start":170,"end":172,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0196","start":196,"end":198,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"xxs_ub0_7rv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"xxs_ub0_7rv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0215","start":215,"end":216,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0222","start":222,"end":223,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0226","start":226,"end":227,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0237","start":237,"end":239,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"xxs_ub0_7rv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0251","start":251,"end":253,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"xxs_ub0_7rv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0254","start":254,"end":256,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"xxs_ub0_7rv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0262","start":262,"end":265,"surface":"齊王廣","kind":"person","person_id":"2sg_8ra_hq5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m015-0268","start":268,"end":269,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin","book_id":"b-shiji-092","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-092-hanxin"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p005","text":"漢三年秋，項羽擊漢，拔滎陽，漢兵遁保鞏、洛。楚人聞淮陰侯破趙，彭越數反梁地，則分兵救之。淮陰方東擊齊，漢王數困滎陽、成皋，計欲捐成皋以東，屯鞏、洛以拒楚。酈生因曰：「臣聞知天之天者，王事可成；不知天之天者，王事不可成。王者以民人為天，而民人以食為天。夫敖倉，天下轉輸久矣，臣聞其下乃有藏粟甚多。楚人拔滎陽，不堅守敖倉，乃引而東，令適卒分守成皋，此乃天所以資漢也。方今楚易取而漢反卻，自奪其便，臣竊以為過矣。且兩雄不俱立，楚漢久相持不決，百姓騷動，海內搖蕩，農夫釋耒，工女下機，天下之心未有所定也。願足下急復進兵，收取滎陽，據敖倉之粟，塞成皋之險，杜大行之道，距蜚狐之口，守白馬之津，以示諸侯效實形制之勢，則天下知所歸矣。方今燕、趙已定，唯齊未下。今田廣據千里之齊，田閒將二十萬之眾，軍於歷城，諸田宗彊，負海阻河濟，南近楚，人多變詐，足下雖遣數十萬師，未可以歲月破也。臣請得奉明詔說齊王，使為漢而稱東藩。」上曰：「善。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m005-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"50g_j9s_2le","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m005-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"淮陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"iu8_4tz_l19","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m005-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"ci2_vzk_6ry","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m005-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"淮陰","kind":"person","person_id":"iu8_4tz_l19","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m005-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m005-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"exh_47e_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m005-0324","start":324,"end":326,"surface":"田廣","kind":"person","person_id":"tj9_mpe_fwt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m005-0332","start":332,"end":334,"surface":"田閒","kind":"person","person_id":"dqz_ka3_on8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m005-0390","start":390,"end":392,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"tj9_mpe_fwt","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli","book_id":"b-shiji-097","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p006","text":"乃從其畫，復守敖倉，而使酈生說齊王曰：「王知天下之所歸乎？」王曰：「不知也。」曰：「王知天下之所歸，則齊國可得而有也；若不知天下之所歸，即齊國未可得保也。」齊王曰：「天下何所歸？」曰：「歸漢。」曰：「先生何以言之？」曰：「漢王與項王力西面擊秦，約先入咸陽者王之。漢王先入咸陽，項王負約不與而王之漢中。項王遷殺義帝，漢王聞之，起蜀漢之兵擊三秦，出關而責義帝之處，收天下之兵，立諸侯之後。降城即以侯其將，得賂即以分其士，與天下同其利，豪英賢才皆樂為之用。諸侯之兵四面而至，蜀漢之粟方船而下。項王有倍約之名，殺義帝之負；於人之功無所記，於人之罪無所忘；戰勝而不得其賞，拔城而不得其封；非項氏莫得用事；為人刻印，刓而不能授；攻城得賂，積而不能賞：天下畔之，賢才怨之，而莫為之用。故天下之士歸於漢王，可坐而策也。夫漢王發蜀漢，定三秦；涉西河之外，援上黨之兵；下井陘，誅成安君；破北魏，舉三十二城：此蚩尤之兵也，非人之力也，天之福也。今已據敖倉之粟，塞成皋之險，守白馬之津，杜大行之阪，距蜚狐之口，天下後服者先亡矣。王疾先下漢王，齊國社稷可得而保也；不下漢王，危亡可立而待也。」田廣以為然，乃聽酈生，罷歷下兵守戰備，與酈生日縱酒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"exh_47e_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"tj9_mpe_fwt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"tj9_mpe_fwt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"50g_j9s_2le","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0138","start":138,"end":140,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"50g_j9s_2le","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0150","start":150,"end":152,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"50g_j9s_2le","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0154","start":154,"end":156,"surface":"義帝","kind":"person","person_id":"eqd_qrh_r6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0175","start":175,"end":177,"surface":"義帝","kind":"person","person_id":"eqd_qrh_r6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0243","start":243,"end":245,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"50g_j9s_2le","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0252","start":252,"end":254,"surface":"義帝","kind":"person","person_id":"eqd_qrh_r6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0342","start":342,"end":344,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0352","start":352,"end":354,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0379","start":379,"end":382,"surface":"成安君","kind":"person","person_id":"82r_i62_9f9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0394","start":394,"end":396,"surface":"蚩尤","kind":"person","person_id":"7hd_xs5_eks","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0456","start":456,"end":458,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0471","start":471,"end":473,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0483","start":483,"end":485,"surface":"田廣","kind":"person","person_id":"tj9_mpe_fwt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0491","start":491,"end":493,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"exh_47e_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m006-0503","start":503,"end":505,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"exh_47e_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli","book_id":"b-shiji-097","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p007","text":"淮陰侯聞酈生伏軾下齊七十餘城，乃夜度兵平原襲齊。齊王田廣聞漢兵至，以為酈生賣己，乃曰：「汝能止漢軍，我活汝；不然，我將亨汝！」酈生曰：「舉大事不細謹，盛德不辭讓。而公不為若更言！」齊王遂亨酈生，引兵東走。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m007-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"淮陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"iu8_4tz_l19","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m007-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"exh_47e_0gw","status":"contextual_pr